@startuml UC01_Sequence
!theme plain

title UC01 - Authentication Sequence Diagram

actor Customer as C
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "User Repository" as DB
participant "Email Service" as Email

C -> Gateway : POST /auth/register
Gateway -> Auth : RegisterRequest
Auth -> Auth : Validate email format
Auth -> Auth : Validate password rules
Auth -> DB : Check duplicate email
DB --> Auth : no duplicate
Auth -> Auth : Hash password
Auth -> DB : Create user
DB --> Auth : user created
Auth -> Email : Send verification email
Email --> Auth : email queued
Auth --> Gateway : 201 Created
Gateway --> C : { user_id, message }

note right of Auth
  Email verification pending
  Account status = unverified
end note

@enduml